The integration of Inflynce with Base offers several advantages:Affordability: Base’s low gas fees make it cost-effective to store and update Inflynce Scores onchain, ensuring accessibility for all users.
Scalability: Base’s high throughput supports Inflynce’s real-time analytics and frequent user interactions.
Interoperability: Scores stored on Base can be used across other Base-based dApps, enhancing composability.
User Engagement: Farcaster’s social features, combined with Base’s wallet connectivity, create a seamless and engaging experience.
Monetization: Integration with Base’s DeFi ecosystem allows users to monetize their social influence through rewards and financial opportunities.

